  "head_commit": {
    "id": "805cafba7152ebdcb5357cd3c9c56076ce1c77aa",
    "tree_id": "193b01be541f51c886818d39674c9be414932a3d",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:751] build the private test IPA 751: S2Arm engine patch 0038 (stutters: mapped region kept out of the guest files), on base 750\n\nFrozen manifest 751: the verified IPA 750 product with the S2Arm engine\nof patches 0001-0038 (run 43686191268, artifact 14151041965, verified pin\ne00f2b00). Patch 0038 keeps MapPhysicalMemory's alias region (NVN pools,\nper-frame GPU buffers) anonymous under guest file backing on a device that\ncannot hold the pool and the host estimate, ported from S2Arm and adapted\nto the 1 GB guest files, and takes S2Arm 3fbde57c (NVN recordings shared\nby content). It targets the page-ins of the 750 log (401 MB read and\n27,886 page-ins per 10 s on average); the region's pages count in the\nfootprint (about +1.2 GB estimated). RPCS3, MeloNX, XeniaCore, the app and\nevery retained component are those of the base. Images that must change:\nS2ArmEngine and Runner. Build-only delivery: Flutter/native groups\nnot-run. Nothing has run on an iPhone; no frame rate, stability or heat\nclaim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-15T06:56:02Z",
